UID:GI5iafom5O
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 111 mins (1h51m)\n\nThis riveting portrait of "Democ
 racy Now!"'s Amy Goodman spotlights journalism's power—and peril—amid 
 rising corporate control and political attacks on the press. Q&A with sub
 ject Amy Goodman and Academy-Award nominated filmmaker Carl Deal at 7pm sc
 reenings April 23 and 24. - Q&A in conversation with editorial cartoonist 
 Ann Telnaes on April 23. - Q&A moderated by KBCS Interim General Manager B
 en Brandow on April  24.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/steal
 -this-story-please\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 3 (Fri 1 May\, 
 4:00 PM)\n  • Uptown House 3 (Sat 2 May\, 1:15 PM)\n  • Uptown House 3
