 y Destroy You's" Michaela Coel make a brilliant pairing in Oscar winner St
 even Soderbergh's incisively witty chamber comedy about art\, commerce\, 
 and avarice.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-christophers\n
 \nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 1 (Thu 30 April\, 4:45 PM)\n  • U
 ptown House 1 (Thu 30 April\, 7:30 PM)\n  • Uptown House 1 (Fri 1 May\, 
 4:45 PM)\n  • Uptown House 1 (Fri 1 May\, 7:30 PM)\n  • Uptown House 1
  (Sat 2 May\, 2:00 PM)\n  • Uptown House 1 (Sat 2 May\, 4:45 PM)\n  • 
