 00 PM)\n  • Uptown House 1 (Sun 3 May\, 4:45 PM)\n  • Uptown House 1 (
 Sun 3 May\, 7:30 PM)\n  • Uptown House 1 (Tue 5 May\, 4:45 PM)\n  • Up
 town House 1 (Tue 5 May\, 7:30 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 19:30
