BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Friend’s House is Here
DTSTART:20260509T211500Z
DTEND:20260509T230500Z
DTSTAMP:20260509T211500Z
UID:aVx3fbk1OH
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nPari and Hanna are best friends a
 nd active participants in Tehran’s vibrant underground arts scene. But t
 he risk of running afoul of the government is omnipresent\, forcing diffic
 ult decisions. This film is generously sponsored by Lynn Dissinger.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.siff.net/festival/the-friends-house-is-here\n\nAlso playing at:\n
   • Uptown House 2 (Fri 8 May\, 8:30 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 14:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yo (Love is a Rebellious Bird)
DTSTART:20260510T000000Z
DTEND:20260510T013500Z
DTSTAMP:20260510T000000Z
UID:hfFUiVa7nf
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 78 mins (1h18m)\n\nA vibrant intergenerational frien
 dship forms between Yo\, 72\, and director Anna\, 24. After Yo’s passing
  at 89\, Anna recreates her world through building a miniature house and p
 uppet\, weaving memories into an intimate vérité portrait.Director Anna 
 Fitch scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/yo-(love-is-a-
 rebellious-bird)\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • PACCAR IMAX Theater at Pacific
  Science Center (Sun 10 May\, 12:00 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Happy Birthday
DTSTART:20260510T030000Z
DTEND:20260510T045000Z
DTSTAMP:20260510T030000Z
UID:JLYMNivk2c
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nEight-year-old Toha has big plans
 \; she wants to throw her friend Nelly a birthday party. But the differenc
 es between them will make this a challenge in ways she may not fully under
 stand. This film is generously sponsored by Xixi & Jonathan Shakes.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.siff.net/festival/happy-birthday\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • PACCA
 R IMAX Theater at Pacific Science Center (Sun 17 May\, 6:30 PM)\n\nEstimat
 ed start: 20:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Under a Million Stars
DTSTART:20260510T193000Z
DTEND:20260510T211500Z
DTSTAMP:20260510T193000Z
UID:1yxPmov91w
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 89 mins (1h29m)\n\nExperts and homeless neighbors al
 ike bust myths about Seattle’s homelessness crisis in a deeply reported\
 , humanistic dispatch from the front lines. Recipient of a 2025 SIFF Grant
  for Courageous Documentary Filmmaking. The 2026 Grant Cycle opens May 15 
 on the SIFF website. Director Chezik Tsunoda scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps
 ://www.siff.net/festival/under-a-million-stars\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • 
 Uptown House 2 (Sat 9 May\, 6:15 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 12:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maintenance Artist
DTSTART:20260510T220000Z
DTEND:20260510T235000Z
DTSTAMP:20260510T220000Z
UID:ECsDTjLToD
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nOverlooked acts like maintaining 
 a house by doing dishes or maintaining a city by picking up garbage can be
  seen as performance art\, or so says Mierle Laderman Ukeles\, the first-e
 ver artist in residence at the New York City Department of Sanitation. Wri
 ter Anne Alvergue scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/ma
 intenance-artist\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • PACCAR IMAX Theater at Pacific
  Science Center (Sat 9 May\, 5:30 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 15:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Ascent
DTSTART:20260511T010000Z
DTEND:20260511T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260511T010000Z
UID:xVYQ3JDZe6
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nMandy Horvath\, a bilateral ampu
 tee battling her past\, embarks on a gripping journey to summit Mount Kili
 manjaro in her quest to become the first legless woman to conquer it witho
 ut prosthetics. Directors Edward Drake and Scott Veltri\, plus Subject Man
 dy Horvath\, scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/the-asc
 ent\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • PACCAR IMAX Theater at Pacific Science Cent
 er (Sat 9 May\, 2:30 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
