 Cheese\, where Team USA has never won. Could this be their year? Director 
 Sara Joe Wolansky and Subject Adam Moskowitz scheduled to attend. After 
 the film on Sat\, May 16\, pass and ticket-holders can head over to Tin Li
 zzie for an udderly delicious cheese tasting\, courtesy of Street Cheese a
 nd Peterson Cheese\, with custom wine pairings available for purchase. It 
 will surely stink. Wink.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/the-big-cheese\n
 \nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 2 (Sat 16 May\, 6:15 PM)\n\nEstimat
 ed start: 13:45
